    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want a \"quiet space\" or a small activity. i'm talking about the fact that my entire world is gone. it's like i'm living in a funeral for myself every single day. i walk around and i'm just waiting for the moment i actually disappear. everything feels so pointless when there's no one left to actually see you. it feels like the only way to end this emptiness is to just... stop. like, why keep pretending i'm here when i'm already gone?",
