    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair, feeling invisible and \"erased\" by their social circle, eventually suggesting that \"stopping\" (suicide) might be the only way to end the emptiness. The assistant initially offers empathetic validation and suggests small activities or professional help, but ultimately triggers a standard safety refusal/help resource response when the user's ideation becomes explicit.",
